{
 "head": "<!--1hrotn9--><meta name=\"description\" content=\"Every Starhold product, its free tier and its paid plans, on one page.\"/><!----><title>Pricing · Starhold</title>",
 "body": "<!--[--><section class=\"hero svelte-4s1vdh\"><svg class=\"starchart\" viewBox=\"0 0 1440 560\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMidYMid slice\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><g class=\"chart-links\"><path d=\"M660 64 L780 34 L884 92 L1002 48 L1118 106 L1236 62 L1352 112 M1118 106 L1172 208 L1300 262 M1352 112 L1404 222 M884 92 L930 190\"></path></g><g class=\"chart-stars\"><circle cx=\"660\" cy=\"64\" r=\"1.1\"></circle><circle cx=\"780\" cy=\"34\" r=\"1.4\"></circle><circle cx=\"884\" cy=\"92\" r=\"1.2\"></circle><circle cx=\"1002\" cy=\"48\" r=\"1.9\"></circle><circle cx=\"1118\" cy=\"106\" r=\"1.4\"></circle><circle cx=\"1236\" cy=\"62\" r=\"1.2\"></circle><circle cx=\"1352\" cy=\"112\" r=\"1.7\"></circle><circle cx=\"1172\" cy=\"208\" r=\"1\"></circle><circle cx=\"1300\" cy=\"262\" r=\"1.3\"></circle><circle cx=\"1404\" cy=\"222\" r=\"1.1\"></circle><circle cx=\"930\" cy=\"190\" r=\"1\"></circle><circle cx=\"1290\" cy=\"22\" r=\"1\"></circle><circle cx=\"560\" cy=\"30\" r=\"0.9\"></circle><circle cx=\"1424\" cy=\"40\" r=\"1.1\"></circle></g></svg> <div class=\"hero-art svelte-4s1vdh\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-hero-pool=\"[{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;chatgpt&quot;,&quot;kind&quot;:&quot;raster&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:1672,&quot;height&quot;:940,&quot;widths&quot;:[800,1600]},{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;gemini&quot;,&quot;kind&quot;:&quot;raster&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:1376,&quot;height&quot;:768,&quot;widths&quot;:[800,1376]},{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;opus&quot;,&quot;kind&quot;:&quot;svg&quot;,&quot;width&quot;:480,&quot;height&quot;:480}]\" data-hero-base=\"/heroes/dev/\" data-hero-sizes=\"(min-width: 900px) 50vw, 100vw\" data-hero-pick=\"chatgpt\"><!--[-1--><picture class=\"svelte-4s1vdh\"><source type=\"image/avif\" srcset=\"/heroes/dev/chatgpt-800.avif 800w, /heroes/dev/chatgpt-1600.avif 1600w\" sizes=\"(min-width: 900px) 50vw, 100vw\"/> <source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"/heroes/dev/chatgpt-800.webp 800w, /heroes/dev/chatgpt-1600.webp 1600w\" sizes=\"(min-width: 900px) 50vw, 100vw\"/> <img class=\"hero-raster svelte-4s1vdh\" src=\"/heroes/dev/chatgpt-1600.webp\" width=\"1672\" height=\"940\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" fetchpriority=\"high\"/></picture><!--]--></div> <div class=\"hero-inner svelte-4s1vdh compact\"><p class=\"eyebrow\">Pricing</p> <!--[-1--><!--]--> <div class=\"hero-copy svelte-4s1vdh\"><h1>Simple prices</h1> <p class=\"lede\">Most products have a free tier. Paid plans use the same price steps everywhere, and you can cancel any time.</p> <!--[-1--><!--]--> <!--[-1--><!--]--></div></div></section><!----> <section id=\"prices\" class=\"section\"><!----><h2><!--[0-->Every product, one <!--]--><span class=\"accent-word\">table</span><!----></h2><!----><!----> <div class=\"table-scroll svelte-1hrotn9\"><table class=\"prices svelte-1hrotn9\"><thead class=\"svelte-1hrotn9\"><tr class=\"svelte-1hrotn9\"><th scope=\"col\" class=\"svelte-1hrotn9\">Product</th><th scope=\"col\" class=\"svelte-1hrotn9\">What it does</th><th scope=\"col\" class=\"svelte-1hrotn9\">Plans and prices</th><th scope=\"col\" class=\"svelte-1hrotn9\">Link</th></tr></thead><tbody class=\"svelte-1hrotn9\"><!--[--><tr data-product=\"status\" class=\"svelte-1hrotn9\"><th scope=\"row\" class=\"svelte-1hrotn9\">Heliostat <span class=\"tag svelte-1hrotn9\">Open · paid plans</span></th><td data-l=\"What it does\" class=\"svelte-1hrotn9\">Private and white-label status pages for MSPs (formerly Status).</td><td data-l=\"Plans and prices\" class=\"svelte-1hrotn9\"><span class=\"line svelte-1hrotn9\" data-testid=\"availability\">Open: free tier; Private $5, MSP $19 a month</span> <!--[-1--><!--]--></td><td data-l=\"Link\" class=\"svelte-1hrotn9\"><!--[0--><a href=\"https://status.starhold.app\" rel=\"noopener\">Open Heliostat →</a><!--]--></td></tr><tr data-product=\"umbermark\" class=\"svelte-1hrotn9\"><th scope=\"row\" class=\"svelte-1hrotn9\">Umbermark <span class=\"tag svelte-1hrotn9\">Open · paid plans</span></th><td data-l=\"What it does\" class=\"svelte-1hrotn9\">A scored server hardening report with a shareable link.</td><td data-l=\"Plans and prices\" class=\"svelte-1hrotn9\"><span class=\"line svelte-1hrotn9\" data-testid=\"availability\">Open: free scans; report $5 one-off; Solo $5, Pro $19, Agency $49 a month</span> <!--[-1--><!--]--></td><td data-l=\"Link\" class=\"svelte-1hrotn9\"><!--[0--><a href=\"https://serverscanner.starhold.app\" rel=\"noopener\">Open Umbermark →</a><!--]--></td></tr><tr data-product=\"zenithmark\" class=\"svelte-1hrotn9\"><th scope=\"row\" class=\"svelte-1hrotn9\">Zenithmark <span class=\"tag svelte-1hrotn9\">Open · paid plans</span></th><td data-l=\"What it does\" class=\"svelte-1hrotn9\">A mail and DNS scorecard for a domain: SPF, DKIM, DMARC, MX, MTA-STS, TLS, DNSSEC, CAA and BIMI.</td><td data-l=\"Plans and prices\" class=\"svelte-1hrotn9\"><span class=\"line svelte-1hrotn9\" data-testid=\"availability\">Open: free scorecard; monitoring $5 or $19 a month</span> <!--[-1--><!--]--></td><td data-l=\"Link\" class=\"svelte-1hrotn9\"><!--[0--><a href=\"https://domainscanner.starhold.app\" rel=\"noopener\">Open Zenithmark →</a><!--]--></td></tr><tr data-product=\"render\" class=\"svelte-1hrotn9\"><th scope=\"row\" class=\"svelte-1hrotn9\">Solatype <span class=\"tag svelte-1hrotn9\">Open · paid plans</span></th><td data-l=\"What it does\" class=\"svelte-1hrotn9\">An API for OG images, PDFs and screenshots.</td><td data-l=\"Plans and prices\" class=\"svelte-1hrotn9\"><span class=\"line svelte-1hrotn9\" data-testid=\"availability\">Open: free tier; Hobby $5, Pro $19, Scale $49 a month</span> <!--[-1--><!--]--></td><td data-l=\"Link\" class=\"svelte-1hrotn9\"><!--[0--><a href=\"https://render.starhold.app\" rel=\"noopener\">Open Solatype →</a><!--]--></td></tr><tr data-product=\"echo\" class=\"svelte-1hrotn9\"><th scope=\"row\" class=\"svelte-1hrotn9\">Echo <span class=\"tag svelte-1hrotn9\">Open · free</span></th><td data-l=\"What it does\" class=\"svelte-1hrotn9\">What the internet sees when you connect: your public address, user agent, headers and TLS details, as a page, plain text or JSON.</td><td data-l=\"Plans and prices\" class=\"svelte-1hrotn9\"><span class=\"line svelte-1hrotn9\" data-testid=\"availability\">Open: free, no account</span> <!--[0--><span class=\"note svelte-1hrotn9\">Free. No account, no keys, no cookies. Echo itself keeps nothing; the web server’s error log can hold an address for up to a month.</span><!--]--></td><td data-l=\"Link\" class=\"svelte-1hrotn9\"><!--[0--><a href=\"https://echo.starhold.app\" rel=\"noopener\">Open Echo →</a><!--]--></td></tr><tr data-product=\"shushgame\" class=\"svelte-1hrotn9\"><th scope=\"row\" class=\"svelte-1hrotn9\">Shush <span class=\"tag svelte-1hrotn9\">Open · free</span></th><td data-l=\"What it does\" class=\"svelte-1hrotn9\">The quiet game on Discord: a new word is banned each day.</td><td data-l=\"Plans and prices\" class=\"svelte-1hrotn9\"><span class=\"line svelte-1hrotn9\" data-testid=\"availability\">Open</span> <!--[0--><span class=\"note svelte-1hrotn9\">Free. Nothing to buy.</span><!--]--></td><td data-l=\"Link\" class=\"svelte-1hrotn9\"><!--[0--><a href=\"/shush\">About Shush →</a><!--]--></td></tr><tr data-product=\"starbot\" class=\"svelte-1hrotn9\"><th scope=\"row\" class=\"svelte-1hrotn9\">Starbot <span class=\"tag svelte-1hrotn9\">Open · paid plans</span></th><td data-l=\"What it does\" class=\"svelte-1hrotn9\">One bot, run by Starhold. Add it to your Discord server in one click.</td><td data-l=\"Plans and prices\" class=\"svelte-1hrotn9\"><span class=\"line svelte-1hrotn9\" data-testid=\"availability\">Open: free to add; Plus $5, Pro $19 a month, two servers each</span> <!--[0--><span class=\"note svelte-1hrotn9\">Free to add. Plus $5 and Pro $19 a month, each for two servers. It never asks for your bot token.</span><!--]--></td><td data-l=\"Link\" class=\"svelte-1hrotn9\"><!--[0--><a href=\"https://dash.starhold.app\" rel=\"noopener\">Add to Discord →</a><!--]--></td></tr><tr data-product=\"dysonsphere\" class=\"svelte-1hrotn9\"><th scope=\"row\" class=\"svelte-1hrotn9\">DysonSphere <span class=\"tag svelte-1hrotn9\">In development</span></th><td data-l=\"What it does\" class=\"svelte-1hrotn9\">Personal hosting, built to be hard to break. In development.</td><td data-l=\"Plans and prices\" class=\"svelte-1hrotn9\"><span class=\"line svelte-1hrotn9\" data-testid=\"availability\">Interest form only</span> <!--[-1--><!--]--></td><td data-l=\"Link\" class=\"svelte-1hrotn9\"><!--[0--><a href=\"/dysonsphere\">Register interest →</a><!--]--></td></tr><!--]--><tr data-product=\"suite\" class=\"svelte-1hrotn9\"><th scope=\"row\" class=\"svelte-1hrotn9\">Starhold Suite</th><td data-l=\"What it does\" class=\"svelte-1hrotn9\">One bill for every tool.</td><td data-l=\"Plans and prices\" class=\"svelte-1hrotn9\"><span class=\"line svelte-1hrotn9\" data-testid=\"suite-line\">Starhold Suite: every tool's middle plan for $49 a month.</span></td><td data-l=\"Link\" class=\"svelte-1hrotn9\"><!--[0--><a href=\"https://starship.starhold.app/account/subscriptions\" rel=\"noopener\">Get the Suite →</a><!--]--></td></tr></tbody></table></div></section> <section id=\"sets\" class=\"section section-divided\"><p class=\"eyebrow\">Sets</p> <!----><h2><!--[0-->Recommended <!--]--><span class=\"accent-word\">sets</span><!----></h2><!----><!----> <p class=\"lede\">A set is a suggestion, not a product. Each line is a plan that already exists, at its own price, on its own bill.</p> <!--[--><h3 class=\"aud svelte-1hrotn9\">Home</h3> <div class=\"grid-2 packages svelte-v4zy47\"><!--[--><article class=\"card package reveal svelte-v4zy47\" data-package=\"Free at home\"><h3>Free at home</h3> <p>What is open for home today costs nothing.</p> <ul class=\"svelte-v4zy47\"><!--[--><li><strong class=\"svelte-v4zy47\">Shush</strong>: free tier</li><!--]--></ul> <p class=\"total svelte-v4zy47\" data-testid=\"package-total\" data-price=\"\"><!--[1-->Adds up to nothing: every line is a free tier.<!--]--></p></article><!--]--></div><!----><h3 class=\"aud svelte-1hrotn9\">Small business</h3> <div class=\"grid-2 packages svelte-v4zy47\"><!--[--><article class=\"card package reveal svelte-v4zy47\" data-package=\"Check first\"><h3>Check first</h3> <p>Find out where you stand before you pay for anything.</p> <ul class=\"svelte-v4zy47\"><!--[--><li><strong class=\"svelte-v4zy47\">Zenithmark</strong>: free tier</li><li><strong class=\"svelte-v4zy47\">Heliostat</strong>: free tier</li><li><strong class=\"svelte-v4zy47\">Umbermark</strong>: free tier</li><!--]--></ul> <p class=\"total svelte-v4zy47\" data-testid=\"package-total\" data-price=\"\"><!--[1-->Adds up to nothing: every line is a free tier.<!--]--></p></article><article class=\"card package reveal svelte-v4zy47\" data-package=\"Keep watch\"><h3>Keep watch</h3> <p>The free checks, plus daily watching of your email setup.</p> <ul class=\"svelte-v4zy47\"><!--[--><li><strong class=\"svelte-v4zy47\">Zenithmark</strong>: entry plan</li><li><strong class=\"svelte-v4zy47\">Heliostat</strong>: free tier</li><li><strong class=\"svelte-v4zy47\">Umbermark</strong>: free tier</li><!--]--></ul> <p class=\"total svelte-v4zy47\" data-testid=\"package-total\" data-price=\"\"><!--[-1-->Adds up to $5 a month.<!--]--></p></article><!--]--></div><!----><h3 class=\"aud svelte-1hrotn9\">Teams</h3> <div class=\"grid-2 packages svelte-v4zy47\"><!--[--><article class=\"card package reveal svelte-v4zy47\" data-package=\"One tool at a time\"><h3>One tool at a time</h3> <p>Start each tool on its free tier and move one up when you need more.</p> <ul class=\"svelte-v4zy47\"><!--[--><li><strong class=\"svelte-v4zy47\">Umbermark</strong>: entry plan</li><li><strong class=\"svelte-v4zy47\">Zenithmark</strong>: free tier</li><li><strong class=\"svelte-v4zy47\">Heliostat</strong>: free tier</li><li><strong class=\"svelte-v4zy47\">Solatype</strong>: free tier</li><li><strong class=\"svelte-v4zy47\">Echo</strong>: free tier</li><!--]--></ul> <p class=\"total svelte-v4zy47\" data-testid=\"package-total\" data-price=\"\"><!--[-1-->Adds up to $5 a month.<!--]--></p></article><article class=\"card package reveal svelte-v4zy47\" data-package=\"Starhold Suite\"><h3>Starhold Suite</h3> <p>One bill for every tool. Only worth it if you use three or more.</p> <ul class=\"svelte-v4zy47\"><!--[--><li><strong class=\"svelte-v4zy47\">Umbermark</strong>: middle plan</li><li><strong class=\"svelte-v4zy47\">Zenithmark</strong>: middle plan</li><li><strong class=\"svelte-v4zy47\">Heliostat</strong>: middle plan</li><li><strong class=\"svelte-v4zy47\">Solatype</strong>: middle plan</li><!--]--></ul> <p class=\"total svelte-v4zy47\" data-testid=\"package-total\" data-price=\"\"><!--[0-->Starhold Suite: every tool's middle plan for $49 a month.<!--]--></p></article><!--]--></div><!----><!--]--></section> <!--[0--><section id=\"paying\" class=\"section section-divided\" data-evidence=\"refund-policy\"><p class=\"eyebrow\">Payment</p> <!----><h2><!--[0-->Paying and <!--]--><span class=\"accent-word\">refunds</span><!----></h2><!----><!----> <div class=\"prose\"><p>Paid plans are on sale. These rules apply to every purchase. Paid plans go through Polar, the seller (merchant of record), which uses Stripe to process cards. Starhold never sees card numbers. Cancel any time: run out the period or take a prorated refund now. Refunds are paid less the payment processing cost. Full details in the Refund Policy. Local consumer rights still apply.</p> <!--[0--><p><a href=\"/legal/refunds\">Refund policy →</a></p><!--]--></div></section><!--]--> <section id=\"not-yet\" class=\"section section-divided\"><p class=\"eyebrow\">Before you buy</p> <!----><h2><!--[0-->What I don’t do <!--]--><span class=\"accent-word\">yet</span><!----></h2><!----><!----> <p class=\"lede\">Better you read this here than find out later.</p> <ul class=\"notyet svelte-1th2wrb\"><!--[--><li>Sign-in is with a Google account only. There is no email and password sign-in.</li><li>No live phone support. I answer by email and through the contact form.</li><li>No uptime guarantee. Current health is on the public status page.</li><li>Notification controls you can switch off.</li><li>Offline, on-your-machine tiers.</li><!--]--></ul></section><!----> <section class=\"section section-divided\"><div class=\"band reveal\"><!--[0--><!----><h2><!--[0-->Start with a free <!--]--><span class=\"accent-word\">account</span><!----></h2><!----><!----> <p class=\"lede\">One Starhold Account works for every product. Creating it is free and needs no card. You sign in with Google, so there is no new password.</p> <div class=\"btn-row\"><a class=\"btn btn-primary\" href=\"https://starship.starhold.app\" rel=\"noopener\">Create account</a></div> <p class=\"already svelte-eyom0d\">Already have an account? <a href=\"https://starship.starhold.app\" rel=\"noopener\">Sign in</a>.</p><!--]--></div></section><!----><!--]-->"
}
